<title>USA: TABLE - SMT Health Services Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - SMT Health Services Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					June 30,		   June 30,</p>
<p>				1997	 1996	  1997	 1996</p>
<p>Total revenues    $6,947,000 $4,628,000 $13,288,000 $8,809,000</p>
<p>Net income	  $  879,000 $  563,000 $ 1,459,000 $1,021,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common share:</p>
<p>Earnings before extraordinary item</p>
<p>			   $  0.15    $  0.14     $  0.30    $  0.27</p>
<p>Extraordinary loss per share</p>
<p>				  --	   --	 (0.03)	  --</p>
<p>Net earnings per share</p>
<p>			   $  0.15    $  0.14     $  0.27    $  0.27</p>
<p>Average number of</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 5,718,000  2,998,000   5,081,000  2,919,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings were partially offset by $220,000 of accrued expenses associated with the company's tender offer and proposed merger with Three Rivers Acquisition Corp, an affiliate of Apollo Management L.P.; excluding such expenses, the company's earnings per share would have been $0.17 for current Q2 and $0.33 for the six-month period.</p>
<p>Full name is SMT Health Services Inc.</p>
